WEBVTT

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:41.000
Are those people the...?

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:47.000
Yeah. The Kaiju Eugenicists.
<i>Kaiju </i>users like me!

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:52.630
They made the <i>kaiju </i>go on a rampage!
Meaning, they're our enemy!

00:01:55.390 --> 00:02:00.020
Gauma, did you forget that we're comrades?

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:02.940
Huh? C-Comrades?

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:05.020
That was way in the past!

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:08.690
Why don't you join us,
just like old times?

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:13.650
I'm not--

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:13.650
Screw that!

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:17.740
What kind of idiot
would take in this traitor?!

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:22.290
Joining you guys is the last thing I'd do!

00:02:22.290 --> 00:02:26.080
Since we finally reunited,
I think I'll kill you!

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:29.460
Bring it on, if you think you can!

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:43.680
Your phoney <i>kaiju </i>seems like
it doesn't want to fight.

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:45.060
Guess not.

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:47.020
Too bad! I'm gonna rip--

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:51.780
Hold up, Onija. Without a <i>kaiju</i>,
we don't stand a chance.

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:54.070
We don't stand a chance?!

00:02:55.450 --> 00:02:56.660
Right.

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:59.490
We'll let him off the hook.

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:02.120
Can we leave after this?

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:03.660
Probably.

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:07.620
So be it! You get to live another day.

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:10.250
But next time, I'll kill you!

00:03:12.840 --> 00:03:15.470
He's such an idiot.

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:20.140
Are you <i>kaiju </i>users, too?

00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:22.640
Uh, no, we're not--

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:26.560
That's right! They've got
the aptitude for it!

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:29.350
That's why they can move Dynazenon.

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:31.270
Dynazenon...

00:03:34.030 --> 00:03:36.240
See you again soon.

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:42.950
What is a Traitor?

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:42.950
Episode 3

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:41.870
Again, soon?

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:51.920
Whoa! Uh-oh!

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:57.470
You guys have it rough
with morning training.

00:03:57.470 --> 00:04:00.390
Will you head to school after this?

00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:03.350
Oh... Nah, I don't go.

00:04:03.350 --> 00:04:05.680
You don't go to school?

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:09.390
When I grow up, I wanna be like Koyomi.

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:11.860
But I did go to middle school.

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:15.320
Besides, I'm not clever like you guys.

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:18.450
I wouldn't say we're clever.

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:21.780
Why don't you join us?

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:23.700
...this traitor!

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:27.620
Traitor? Referring to Gauma?

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:29.580
Yomogi, stay focused!

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:30.580
Huh?

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:35.250
Combining is a long way off.

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:37.800
I'm gonna head to school.

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:40.130
Bye!

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:44.050
In an instant of time,
the arrow in flight is stationary.

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:48.600
The duration of flight
consists of all those instants.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:51.020
Remember, photos are due today--

00:04:53.150 --> 00:04:55.520
Oh. Where you headed?

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.990
Music room. Coming?

00:04:57.990 --> 00:05:01.780
Huh? Uh, sure.

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:04.410
Got work today?

00:05:04.410 --> 00:05:05.620
Yeah.

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:07.490
Are you in a hurry?

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:10.210
No. It's a late start.

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:11.460
I see.

00:05:11.460 --> 00:05:13.830
What's at the music room?

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:15.250
Chorus club.

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:21.760
Kano... I mean, my big sister was in it.

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:23.470
Oh, yeah?

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:27.390
I thought I'd ask around
and see what I learn.

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:28.970
Music Prep Room

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:32.520
Yeah, I was the club advisor
five years ago,

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:36.360
but I can't remember much
about your sister.

00:05:36.360 --> 00:05:37.860
I see.

00:05:37.860 --> 00:05:40.190
Oh, but Kanae might know.

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:41.360
Huh?

