00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:54.730
<i>Kaiju </i>and robots.
We live in dangerous times.

00:06:54.730 --> 00:06:59.360
Someone I know from club said
their neighborhood got wrecked.

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:02.070
Yomogi doesn't even seem to care.

00:07:02.070 --> 00:07:04.700
No, that's not true.

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:06.160
Hello.

00:07:07.950 --> 00:07:10.120
Do you have a moment?

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:12.330
Uh, sure.

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:17.250
Who's that?

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:21.210
